title: Veeam: Backup repository
agents: special
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors a backup repository of a Veeam Backup & Replication
 server, collected via the Veeam special agent. It reports the repository's
 used space, and, in the details, its host, path and description.

 This check is {CRIT} if the repository is offline; no further checks are
 done in that case. It is {WARN} if the repository is out of date. The
 used space is evaluated like any other filesystem, and its {WARN} and {CRIT}
 levels are configured with the rule "File systems (used space and growth)".

 This check does not report capacity for a scale-out repository itself,
 since a scale-out repository has no capacity of its own; capacity lives on
 its extents, each of which is discovered as its own repository service.

discovery:
 One service is created for each backup repository and each scale-out
 repository extent reported by the API.

item:
 The repository type (or, for a scale-out repository extent, its extent
 type) followed by the repository name.
